Package: stt.api
Title: 'OpenAI' Compatible Speech-to-Text API Client
Version: 0.3.1.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", email = "troy@cornball.ai", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: A minimal-dependency R client for 'OpenAI'-compatible speech-to-text
    APIs (see <https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/audio>) with
    optional local fallbacks. Supports 'OpenAI', local servers, the
    'whisper' package for local transcription, and a fleet GPU host through
    the 'gpu.host' package, with local speaker labels from the 'n3d'
    package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/cornball-ai/stt.api
BugReports: https://github.com/cornball-ai/stt.api/issues
